ext-[38px] sm:leading-[44px] sm:tracking-[-1.8px] md:text-[56px] md:leading-[62px] md:tracking-[-3px] lg:text-[66px] lg:leading-[72px] lg:tracking-[-3.96px]"><span class="text-bold-amber">Good energies,</span> <span class="text-ever-teal-100">wherever you are</span></h2><p class="text-dark-2 font-normal text-[18px] leading-[26px] tracking-[-0.36px] md:text-[20px] md:leading-[28px] md:tracking-[-0.4px] mt-4 min-[1440px]:mt-6">Our renewable energy assets operate across 17 countries in six continents, supported by in-house global R&amp;D centres, end-to-end manufacturing strength, and service capabilities across markets.</p></div></header><div class="mt-[70px] md:mt-10 min-[1440px]:mt-[29px]"><div class="relative h-[575px] md:h-[620px] lg:h-[700px] min-[1440px]:h-[760px] w-full isolate"><div class="relative h-full w-full"><div class="absolute inset-0 overflow-hidden isolate"><div class="absolute inset-0 z-0 select-none cursor-grab active:cursor-grabbing" style="perspective:1200px;perspective-origin:50% 120%"><div class="absolute inset-0" style="transform:rotateX(15deg) scale(1.20) translateY(-10%);transform-origin:50% 0%"></div></div></div><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 z-20 transition-all duration-300 ease-out" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(0px);visibility:visible"><div class="absolute bottom-[calc(16px+env(safe-area-inset-bottom))] right-[calc(16px+env(safe-area-inset-right))] z-20 flex gap-[10px]" style="pointer-events:auto"><button type="button" class="flex size-10 items-center justify-center rounded-[8px] bg-ever-teal-100 text-white text-[20px] font-medium leading-[1] shadow-sm transition-all duration-200 ease-out hover:scale-110 hover:shadow-md hover:brightness-110 active:scale-95" aria-label="Zoom in">+</button><button type="button" class="flex size-10 items-center justify-center rounded-[8px] bg-ever-teal-100 text-white text-[20px] font-medium leading-[1] shadow-sm transition-all duration-200 ease-out hover:scale-110 hover:shadow-md ho