stand by</h2></div><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-12 lg:w-[780px] lg:gap-[64px]"><div class="flex flex-col"><div class="border-t border-dark-2/45 pt-8 lg:pt-[32px] pb-12 lg:pb-16 min-[1440px]:pb-[80px] flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-6 md:gap-10 lg:gap-14 min-[1440px]:gap-[120px]"><p class="whitespace-pre-line w-full md:w-[200px] shrink-0 text-ever-teal-100 font-semibold text-[20px] leading-[26px] tracking-[-0.8px] lg:text-[22px] lg:leading-[28px] lg:tracking-[-0.88px]">Courage in every step</p><p class="text-dark-2 font-normal text-[20px] leading-[28px] tracking-[-0.8px] lg:tracking-[-0.88px]">We take on complex energy challenges with clarity, conviction, and responsibility.</p></div><div class="border-t border-dark-2/45 pt-8 lg:pt-[32px] pb-12 lg:pb-16 min-[1440px]:pb-[80px] flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-6 md:gap-10 lg:gap-14 min-[1440px]:gap-[120px]"><p class="whitespace-pre-line w-full md:w-[200px] shrink-0 text-ever-teal-100 font-semibold text-[20px] leading-[26px] tracking-[-0.8px] lg:text-[22px] lg:leading-[28px] lg:tracking-[-0.88px]">Empathy for all</p><p class="text-dark-2 font-normal text-[20px] leading-[28px] tracking-[-0.8px] lg:tracking-[-0.88px]">We create with care for clients, teams, partners, shareholders, communities, and the planet.</p></div><div class="border-t border-dark-2/45 pt-8 lg:pt-[32px] pb-12 lg:pb-16 min-[1440px]:pb-[80px] flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-6 md:gap-10 lg:gap-14 min-[1440px]:gap-[120px]"><p class="whitespace-pre-line w-full md:w-[200px] shrink-0 text-ever-teal-100 font-semibold text-[20px] leading-[26px] tracking-[-0.8px] lg:text-[22px] lg:leading-[28px] lg:tracking-[-0.88px]">Making it happen, now</p><p class="text-dark-2 font-normal text-[20px] leading-[28px] tracking-[-0.8px] lg:tracking-[-0.88px]">We move with discipline, speed, and accountability to turn clean energy ambition into action.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="relative hidden w-full lg:block" style="height:1700px"><div class="w-full bg-humble